-- Greenwich area: Darien Library, Athena Books, Gold Coast Mahjong Club and six weekly sessions
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Southwest Connecticut''s American mahjong is spread across libraries, a bookstore and clubs along the Gold Coast. Darien Library holds a weekly drop-in game where players bring the National Mah Jongg League card and play without instruction, Athena Books in Greenwich hosts evenings of American-style mahjong with treats and friendly competition, and Gold Coast Mahjong Club runs leagues, private lessons and social events across Fairfield County. Check each listing for dates. If you are new, start with a private lesson before you join the drop-in game.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'greenwich';
